# twin_mode7.config -- Phase 4b Task 7 FLAGSHIP (TwinBlstmSpectralLid / Algo 6, Mode 7).
# The committed configs/legacy/LID_BLSTM.config RE-POINTED (File_Type 1, phSeq corpus,
# real 95k LID net -> LID_bestNNWeight_1.bin, clean test paths), effective (last-wins)
# duplicate keys collapsed. The SAD net (BLSTM) is NEVER run in Mode 7 (result_vec is
# synthesized constant 10.0 at :726 and the external-features loop ignores the SAD
# classification), so its weights are irrelevant -- it is built with default init and
# left unloaded, matching the committed config's commented-out BLSTM_weightsFile.
